# WFORMTP.KEY - a partial save: the ADD of a new item succeeds, the SET
# of the fields it could not carry fails; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTP.SNP.
# SHIFT-F2 opens the item form whose SERIALNO is FF_NEWONLY too.  Long
# texts in Type, Maker, Model, Serial and Description fill the ADD, so
# the tags, one of them bad, go in a SET of their own.
K SHIFT-F2
T CC
K TAB TAB
T TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
K TAB
T N
K ALT-M
T MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM
K TAB
T OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO
K ALT-E
T SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS
K TAB
T DDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDD
K ALT-G
T a*b,ccccccccccc,ddddddddddd,eeeeeeeeeee,fffffffffff,gggggggg
K ENTER
# MF_PARTIAL in a message box over the dialog, captioned with the ID
# the ADD gave.
S PARTIAL
K ENTER
# Then the failed SET's field error: the focus on Tags, the new ID
# shown, Serial (FF_NEWONLY) now read-only.
S TAGFAIL
K ALT-E
T X
S LOCKED
# Good tags: OK sends only the SET, and the item is shown again.
K ALT-G
T retro
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ESC
S DONE
